<!-- BEGIN release-kit -->

## Workflow

- This repository runs the release-kit workflow. `rk method invariants` states what must stay true.
RK_AGENT_POLICY- Every commit that reaches the trunk MUST be a Conventional Commit.
RK_COMMIT_POLICY- Run `rk status` before changing any file `.release-kit/manifest.json` names. Before reading a gap in `rk setup check` as a setup defect, run `rk setup status`. A credential this runtime cannot reach leaves a step unknown, which is an observation boundary and not drift. Never ask the operator to mount, expose, recreate, or rotate a secret only so an agent check can pass.
- The full method is `rk method --list`.

<!-- END release-kit -->
